    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d277">

                <pb facs="0810" n="794" sameAs="frus:frus1951v01/pg794"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">S/S-NSC Files, Lot
                    63 D 351, NSC 120 Series<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d277-f1"/>
                </note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Report to the National Security Council by the Executive
                        Secretary</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Lay</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-12-21">December 21,
                        1951</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">NSC 120</p>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Communication of Data to Canadians Concerning New
                        Ore Refinery</hi>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Note by the Executive Secretary</hi>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Reference: Public Law 235, 82nd Congress<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d277-f2"/>
                </p>
                <p>The President has referred the enclosed letter on the subject from the Atomic
                    Energy Commission, to the National Security Council for written recommendation
                    pursuant to subsection 10(a) (3) of the Atomic Energy Act of 1946, as amended by
                    Public Law 235, 82nd Congress.</p>
                <p>Accordingly, the enclosed letter is being referred to the Senior NSC Staff to prepare a written recommendation for
                    consideration by the Council.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">James S. Lay, Jr</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d277-a1.xml" xpointer="d277-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
